<article class="env-lemma" id="0C4Z">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0C4Z">Lemma <span data-tag="0C4Z">33.5.2</span>.</a> Notation as in Lemma <a href="/tag/0C4Y" data-tag="0C4Y">33.5.1</a>. Assume $X$ is locally of finite type over $k$. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \dim (\mathcal{O}_{Y, y}/\mathfrak m_ x\mathcal{O}_{Y, y}) = \text{trdeg}_ k(\kappa (x)) - \text{trdeg}_ K(\kappa (y)) = \dim (\mathcal{O}_{Y, y}) - \dim (\mathcal{O}_{X, x})  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a restatement of Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/0CWE" data-tag="0CWE">10.116.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>